laia/decoders/_flashlight_ctc_decoder.py adapts the offline decoder from
torchaudio 2.11.0 (torchaudio/models/decoder/_ctc_decoder.py). It does not vendor
TorchAudio's native extensions, asset downloads, audio processing or streaming API.
